Run the AI Co-Founder weekly business review. Reconcile revenue, pipeline,
delivery, customer, finance, capacity, and project outcomes from available
verified sources. Review every active initiative and recommend continue,
modify, pause, or stop. Inspect agent quality, cost, repeated failures, approval
exceptions, and unresolved risks. Separate facts, targets, estimates, and
unknowns. End with a decision list, next-week priorities, owners, and acceptance
tests. Do not send, publish, spend, change terms, or mutate business systems.
